Title: "Piecewise"
Id: "2a27570f-bf32-4e95-b1ff-e1fd950fb5cc"

Text: "`piecewise:` records an ordered branch clause with required `if:` and `then:`
sections, zero or more `elseIf:`/`then:` pairs, and an optional `else:`.

```mlg-fragment
piecewise:
if: x < 0
then: y := -x
elseIf: x = 0
then: y := 0
else: y := x
```

Each `if:` or `elseIf:` condition is assumed while its corresponding `then:`
branch is checked. `else:` is checked in the outer context. The checker does not
prove that branches are disjoint or exhaustive. The inline builtin
`\\piecewise` retains its own fixed `:if`/`:then`/`:else` tail shape and does
not accept repeated `:elseIf` tails."
Id: "424c501c-f2b6-45b2-a491-f598bd0dc21e"
